From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flange <flange@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dts: rk3568-evb: 在 U-Boot 阶段打开 NPU 供电（RK809 DCDC4 vdd_npu）

仅适用于 RK809 方案、DCDC4 = vdd_npu 的板（RK3568 EVB 同款电源树）。

启用 NPU 后开机在 rknpu_mmu probe 时 panic：

  failed to get ack on domain 'npu', target_idle = 0, target_ack = 0, val=0x6
  Kernel panic - not syncing: panic_on_set_idle set ...

根因：rk356x.dtsi 的 rknpu_mmu 挂 power-domains = <RK3568_PD_NPU>，
drivers/iommu 链接顺序早于 drivers/mfd，IOMMU probe 打开 NPU 电源域时
PMIC 驱动尚未 probe；NPU 电源轨不在 PMIC 硬件上电时序内（RK3566 硬件
设计指南：NPU 电源可开机后再打开），此刻无电，NIU 不回 idle ack。
RK3588/RK3576 的 rknpu_mmu 不挂电源域、由 rknpu 驱动先 regulator_enable
再开域，故不受影响。

厂商板（Radxa ROCK 3A/3B/3C、Orange Pi CM4/3B、Armbian vendor 分支）都
靠板级 U-Boot DTS 里带 boot-on 的 NPU regulator 节点在进内核前上电；
flange 用通用 rk3568_defconfig（DT=rk3568-evb，无 PMIC 节点）且 extlinux
启动时 U-Boot 读不到内核 DTB，从未碰过这路电源。本补丁在 evb dts 追加
最小 PMIC 节点，只声明 NPU 供电那一路，由 regulators_enable_boot_on()
设 0.9V 并使能。串口应出现 "PMIC:  RK8xx" 与 "<name> init 900000 uV"。

依赖：SoC 层 bootloader.config 把 interrupt-parent 移出
CONFIG_OF_SPL_REMOVE_PROPS，否则 dt.dtb 丢掉该属性，
rk8xx_ofdata_to_platdata() 失败、PMIC 不 probe。

参考：armbian/linux-rockchip#297、armbian/build#7025。
orangepi-cm4 实板验证：vdd_npu 900mV enabled，rknpu 0.9.8 加载，
debugfs power on 后 NPU PD on / iommu active。
---
  arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts | 51 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
  1 file changed, 51 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts b/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
index 614736a..1b17352 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
@@ -104,3 +104,54 @@
 &uart2 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+/*
+ * flange: 在 U-Boot 阶段打开 NPU 供电（rk809 DCDC_REG4 / vdd_npu）。
+ *
+ * BSP 内核的 rknpu_mmu 挂着 RK3568_PD_NPU，IOMMU probe 早于 rk809 驱动，
+ * 会在 NPU 电源轨尚未上电时打开 NPU 电源域 → NIU 不回 idle ack →
+ * pm_domains.c panic_on_set_idle。这里只声明该路 DCDC，由
+ * regulators_enable_boot_on() 调到 0.9V 并使能；PMIC 属性与内核 dts 一致。
+ * u-boot.dtb 经 fdtgrep 只保留 u-boot,dm-pre-reloc / dm-spl 节点，故
+ * i2c0 → pinctrl → pmic → regulator 整条链都要标记。
+ */
+&i2c0 {
+	u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+	status = "okay";
+
+	rk809: pmic@20 {
+		u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+		compatible = "rockchip,rk809";
+		reg = <0x20>;
+		interrupt-parent = <&gpio0>;
+		interrupts = <3 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW>;
+		/* 1: rst regs (default in codes), 0: rst the pmic */
+		pmic-reset-func = <0>;
+		/* not save the PMIC_POWER_EN register in uboot */
+		not-save-power-en = <1>;
+
+		regulators {
+			u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+
+			vdd_npu: DCDC_REG4 {
+				u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+				regulator-always-on;
+				regulator-boot-on;
+				regulator-min-microvolt = <500000>;
+				regulator-max-microvolt = <1350000>;
+				regulator-init-microvolt = <900000>;
+				regulator-ramp-delay = <6001>;
+				regulator-initial-mode = <0x2>;
+				regulator-name = "vdd_npu";
+			};
+		};
+	};
+};
+
+&i2c0_xfer {
+	u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+};
+
+&pcfg_pull_none_smt {
+	u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
+};
